{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00520","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 九和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 九和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祗荷坤德，钦若乾灵。\n慙惕罔寘，兴居匪宁。\n恭崇礼则，肃奉仪形。\n惟凭展敬，敢荐非馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}